},{"surface":"பட்டன்று","parts":[{"text":"பட்டன்று","lemma":"paṭu","gloss":"it has become"}],"gloss":"it has become"},{"surface":"மன்னே","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"maṉ","gloss":"particle of regret"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"alas"},{"surface":"இன்றே","parts":[{"text":"இன்று","lemma":"iṉṟu","gloss":"today"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"today indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அடங்கிய","parts":[{"text":"அடங்கிய","lemma":"aṭaṅku","gloss":"subdued/modest"}],"gloss":"modest"},{"surface":"கற்பின்","parts":[{"text":"கற்பு","lemma":"kaṟpu","gloss":"chastity/faithfulness"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of faithful chastity"},{"surface":"ஆய்நுதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆய்","lemma":"āy","gloss":"beautiful/select"},{"text":"நுதல்","lemma":"nutal","gloss":"forehead"}],"gloss":"beautiful forehead"},{"surface":"மடந்தை","parts":[{"text":"மடந்தை","lemma":"maṭantai","gloss":"young woman/wife"}],"gloss":"young wife"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உயர்நிலை","parts":[{"text":"உயர்","lemma":"uyar","gloss":"high"},{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"nilai","gloss":"state/status"}],"gloss":"high-state"},{"surface":"உலகம்","parts":[{"text":"உலகம்","lemma":"ulakam","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world (heaven)"},{"surface":"அவன்புக","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"he"},{"text":"புக","lemma":"puka","gloss":"to enter"}],"gloss":"as he entered"},{"surface":"…","parts":[{"text":"…","lemma":"…","gloss":"gap"}],"gloss":"gap"},{"surface":"வரி","parts":[{"text":"வரி","lemma":"vari","gloss":"lines/streaks"}],"gloss":"lines"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீறாடு","parts":[{"text":"நீறு","lemma":"nīṟu","gloss":"ash/dust"},{"text":"ஆடு","lemma":"āṭu","gloss":"to bathe/smear"}],"gloss":"dust-covered"},{"surface":"சுளகின்","parts":[{"text":"சுளகு","lemma":"cuḷaku","gloss":"winnowing fan"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"iṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the winnowing fan"},{"surface":"சீறிடம்","parts":[{"text":"சீறிடம்","lemma":"சீறிடம்","gloss":"small space"}],"gloss":"small space","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நீக்கி","parts":[{"text":"நீக்கி","lemma":"nīkki","gloss":"having cleared"}],"gloss":"having cleared"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அழுதல்","parts":[{"text":"அழுதல்","lemma":"aḻu","gloss":"weeping"}],"gloss":"weeping"},{"surface":"ஆனாக்","parts":[{"text":"ஆனாக்","lemma":"ஆனாக்","gloss":"unceasing"}],"gloss":"unceasing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்ணள்","parts":[{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"eye"},{"text":"அள்","lemma":"aḷ","gloss":"she who has"}],"gloss":"she with eyes"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெழுகு","parts":[{"text":"மெழுகு","lemma":"meḻuku","gloss":"to smear/clean"}],"gloss":"smeared"},{"surface":"ஆப்பிகண்","parts":[{"text":"ஆப்பி","lemma":"āppi","gloss":"cow dung"},{"text":"கண்","lemma":"kaṇ","gloss":"place/on"}],"gloss":"on the cow-dung floor"},{"surface":"கலுழ்நீ","parts":[{"text":"கலுழ்நீ","lemma":"கலுழ்நீ","gloss":"turbid tears"}],"gloss":"turbid tears","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ரானே","parts":[{"text":"ரானே","lemma":"ரானே","gloss":"with indeed"}],"gloss":"with indeed","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Sharp-snouted spiny eel hiding in the mud below / thick-bodied scabbard fish leaping on the surface water / crushing the flame-flowered pond together, the fishermen / making the turtle roll over like a rasping-voiced drum / with egg-laden murrel fish like palmyra sprouts / scooping up bright carp like clashing spears / the food of the lord of the wide country, yesterday / aiming to share in a public place, gathering with many / became one way (ended), alas! Today / the young wife of modest chastity and beautiful forehead / as he entered the high-state world (heaven) ... lines / clearing a small space with a dust-covered winnowing fan / she with eyes of unceasing weeping / on the floor smeared with cow dung, with turbid tears.","translation":"Yesterday, the lord of the wide country gathered with many in a public place to share a feast of rich fish—sharp-snouted eels that hide in the mud, thick-bodied scabbard fish leaping on the water's surface, turtles rolled over by fishermen thrashing the flame-flowered ponds like rattling drums, egg-laden murrels shaped like palmyra sprouts, and bright carp resembling clashing spears. Alas, that is all gone today! As he entered the high heaven, his young wife of modest chastity and beautiful forehead cleared a small spot on the floor with a dusty winnowing fan, and with unceasing tears, she wept upon the ground freshly smeared with cow dung.","modern":"கூர்மையான மூக்கையுடைய ஆரல் மீன்கள் கீழே உள்ள சேற்றில் ஒளிந்து கொள்ளவும், பருத்த உடலையுடைய வாளை மீன்கள் நீரின் மேல் பரப்பில் துள்ளி விளையாடவும், நெருப்புப் போன்ற மலர்களைக் கொண்ட குளத்தை ஒன்றாகக் கலக்கி, வலைஞர்கள் ஒலிக்கும் உடுக்கையைப் போல ஆமைகளைப் புரட்டிப் போடவும், பனை முளை போன்ற சினை முதிர்ந்த வரால் மீன்களோடு, போரிடும் வேல் போன்ற ஒளிரும் கயல் மீன்களையும் அள்ளி முகக்கும் அகன்ற நாட்டின் தலைவனுடைய உணவு, நேற்றுப் பகல் பொழுதில் பலரோடும் கூடிப் பகிர்ந்து உண்ணப்பட்டது. ஆனால் இன்று அது ஒரு முடிவுக்கு வந்துவிட்டது! அடக்கமான கற்பும் அழகிய நெற்றியும் கொண்ட அவனது மனைவி, அவன் மேலுலகம் சென்றதால், தூசு படிந்த முறத்தால் ஒரு சிறிய இடத்தை சுத்தம் செய்துவிட்டு, பசுஞ்சாணம் மெழுகிய அவ்விடத்தில் தன் ஓயாத கண்ணீரால் அழுது கொண்டிருக்கிறாள்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Potuviyal tiṇai and depicts the theme of Tāpatatilai, which describes the sorrowful state of a widow mourning her deceased husband. The poet contrasts the joyful abundance of yesterday with the bleak, tragic reality of today. Yesterday, the generous chieftain of a fertile agricultural land hosted a grand feast, sharing various kinds of fish and turtles caught from the rich local ponds with his people. Today, the chieftain has passed away and entered the heavenly world, leaving his chaste and beautiful wife in deep grief. She is shown clearing a small space on the cow-dung-smeared floor with a dusty winnowing fan, weeping uncontrollably. The vivid imagery of the fertile wetlands highlights the chieftain's past glory and generosity, making the present scene of mourning even more poignant.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.47],[1.47,1.8],[1.8,2.63],[2.63,2.91],[2.91,3.32],[3.32,3.83],[4.07,4.3],[4.3,4.59],[4.59,4.59],[4.59,6.5],[6.5,6.66],[6.7,7.8],[7.8,8.28],[8.28,8.8],[8.8,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,12.8],[12.8,13.2],[13.2,13.5],[13.5,13.9],[13.9,14.81],[15.04,15.5],[15.5,16.06],[16.06,16.06],[16.06,17.0],[17.0,17.24],[17.4,17.9],[17.9,18.1],[18.96,19.66],[19.66,20.06],[20.06,20.46],[20.46,20.86],[20.86,21.56],[21.56,22.06],[22.06,22.56],[22.56,22.86],[22.86,23.96],[23.96,24.36],[24.36,24.86],[24.86,25.06],[25.06,25.66],[25.76,25.86],[25.86,26.56],[26.56,26.76],[26.76,27.96],[27.96,28.26],[28.26,28.46],[28.46,29.66],[29.66,30.18],[30.18,30.73],[30.73,31.06]],"female":[[0.0,1.0],[1.09,1.6],[1.6,1.68],[1.85,2.1],[2.1,3.12],[3.12,3.45],[3.45,3.96],[3.96,4.57],[4.83,5.1],[5.1,6.2],[6.2,6.31],[6.42,7.4],[7.52,8.1],[8.1,9.0],[9.0,9.6],[9.6,10.2],[10.2,10.4],[10.91,12.2],[12.2,12.5],[12.5,13.25],[13.25,13.53],[13.53,13.6],[13.6,15.5],[15.5,15.8],[15.8,16.2],[16.2,17.26],[17.47,17.9],[17.9,18.43],[18.43,18.43],[18.43,19.3],[19.3,20.0],[20.0,20.6],[20.6,20.8],[21.8,22.6],[22.6,23.0],[23.0,23.7],[23.7,24.0],[24.0,25.0],[25.0,25.4],[25.4,26.0],[26.0,26.4],[26.4,27.7],[27.7,28.1],[28.1,28.8],[28.8,29.0],[29.0,29.86],[29.86,30.5],[30.5,31.0],[31.0,31.2],[31.2,32.5],[32.5,32.8],[32.8,33.0],[33.0,34.1],[34.1,34.69],[34.69,35.2],[35.2,35.6]]}}